	PDP-12 ADDRESS TEST
	 
	STARTING ADDRESS
	LOC. 20
	 
	SWITCH SETTINGS
	SR00 = 1 SUPPRESS HALT
	SR01 = 1 SUPPRESS PRINTOUT
